{"id":"desagradable","lemma":"desagradable","pos":"adj","rank":1813,"glosses":["unpleasant, disagreeable, distasteful, off-putting, displeasing, unpleasing, bad, rude, unsavory, uncomfortable, unlikable, objectionable, painful, uncongenial, crappy, gnarly (US slang)","nasty, ugly, unkind, objectionable, unsightly (e.g., person, behavior)"],"ipa":"/desaɡɾaˈdable/","forms":{"femininePlural":"desagradables"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-desagradable.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Qué desagradable sorpresa!","en":"What an unpleasant surprise!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600210","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"surprise"}]},{"text":"La situación es desagradable.","en":"The situation is ugly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301851","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"situation"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"El olor era desagradable.","en":"The smell was offensive.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705453","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"smell, scent, odor"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Tuvimos una experiencia desagradable allí.","en":"We had an unpleasant experience there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/615892","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"experience"},null,{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Él tiene una mirada desagradable.","en":"He has an unpleasant look in his eyes.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"look, glance"},null]}]}